<p id="mwDA"><i id="mwDQ"><b id="mwDg">Neostenanthera neurosericea</b></i> is a species of flowering plant in the family <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Annonaceae" title="Annonaceae" id="mwDw">Annonaceae</a>. It is a shrub or tree native to southwestern <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Cameroon" title="Cameroon" id="mwEA">Cameroon</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Gabon" title="Gabon" id="mwEQ">Gabon</a>.<sup about="#mwt11" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-powo_2-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"powo"}}'><a href="./Neostenanthera_neurosericea#cite_note-powo-2" id="mwEg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFA">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwFg">This plant is known to science by only 14 specimens collected from eight locations. It is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Shrub" title="Shrub" id="mwFw">shrub</a> or tree generally growing <span about="#mwt12" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"convert","href":"./Template:Convert"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"3"},"2":{"wt":"to"},"3":{"wt":"5"},"4":{"wt":"m"},"5":{"wt":"ft"},"6":{"wt":"0"}},"i":0}}]}' id="mwGA">3 to 5 metres (10 to 16</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt12"> </span><span about="#mwt12">ft)</span> tall, sometimes reaching <span about="#mwt13" typeof="mw:Transclusion" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"convert","href":"./Template:Convert"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"10"},"2":{"wt":"m"},"3":{"wt":"ft"}},"i":0}}]}' id="mwGQ">10 metres (33</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt13"> </span><span about="#mwt13">ft)</span>. It has showy flowers and fruits. Its pollen is shed as permanent tetrads.<sup about="#mwt16" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-GuoTang2017_3-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"GuoTang2017"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-GuoTang2017-3"}}'><a href="./Neostenanthera_neurosericea#cite_note-GuoTang2017-3" id="mwGg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHQ">]</span></span></a></sup> It grows in evergreen forest habitat.<sup about="#mwt17" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iucn_1-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iucn"}}'><a href="./Neostenanthera_neurosericea#cite_note-iucn-1" id="mwHg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwHw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIA">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwIg">This is a vulnerable species threatened by habitat loss as forest is cleared for agriculture.<sup about="#mwt18" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iucn_1-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iucn"}}'><a href="./Neostenanthera_neurosericea#cite_note-iucn-1" id="mwIw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJQ">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

